finalizeCowOrder
├── Given missing module or previously finalized order
│   └── It rejects duplicate accounting
├── Given proven fill
│   ├── ysy principal BOLD credits pendingProtocolBold only
│   └── Other sources credit pendingBold only
├── Given no fill
│   ├── Operator waits until strictly past expiry
│   └── Safe can cancel early and refund restores original source
├── Given execution paused
│   └── Existing orders may still fill and reconciliation remains available
└── Given actual receipt differs
    └── It rolls back all credits
